      "writtenOn": "2025-12-03T02:12:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "PDFium implicitly defaults to the `chromium_code` GN build config, which passes `-Wshadow` to the compiler. So if `pMyCoolVariable` gets renamed to `my_cool_variable`, and `my_cool_variable` already exists, the compiler will catch that.",
